    <l n="32" type="heading" level="1" caput="3">Liber III.</l>
    <l n="33" type="heading" level="2" para="true">ἀφοριστικῶς[?] ἢ ἀναλυτικῶς tractatus.</l>
    <l n="34" para="true">I. Atq; hactenus de singulis seorsim; nunc</l>
    <l n="35">conjunctè deinceps de honesto &amp; utili;</l>
    <l n="36">sive nimirum honestum quid videatur, quod utile</l>
    <l n="37">non sit, sive contrà.</l>
    <l n="38" para="true">
      <i>II. Illa enim contentio magnam de officio</i>
    </l>
    <l n="39">
      <i>difficultatem adfert. Ubi generaliter statuendum,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="40">
      <i>nihil honestum, esse, quin utile sit &amp; vicissim.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="41" para="true">
      <i>Quæ Socratis sanctissima illa doctrina, execrantis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="42">
      <i>etiam eos, qui occæcati specie quadam, primùm</i>
    </l>
    <l n="43">
      <i>ista contra naturam distraxissent.</i>
    </l>
